help: Some("Write the full tracing log to the given file")
long_help: Some("Write the full tracing log to the given file.\n\nUse `-` to stream logs to stderr instead. When unset, the log is written to a temporary file. `JP_DEBUG=1` announces its path before execution and keeps it afterward. Runs lasting at least five minutes repeat the path at completion. A failed run without `JP_DEBUG` reports the retained path at completion.")

