long_help: Some("End of the range, inclusive.\n\nAccepts the same forms as `--from`, except `last-compaction`, which only makes sense as a start bound.\n\nA time-based value ends the selection at (and includes) the turn that was running at the given instant — the mirror of `--from`, which excludes it. A bound never splits a turn.")

