long_help: Some("Extra guidance for the summarizer, e.g. \"focus on the architecture\".\n\nRides on the summarization request as supplementary context; it adds to the summarizer's instructions rather than replacing them. Applies to every rule in this invocation that generates a summary, overriding any `conversation.compaction.rules[].summary.context` they set themselves. Has no effect on a verbatim `--summary TEXT`, which calls no model.")

### over
