set: []
help: Some("Only compact items larger than this")
long_help: Some("Only compact items larger than this.\n\nAccepts a human-readable size (`512KB`, `1MB`) or a bare byte count. Applies to every mechanical policy this invocation sets; use the inline DSL (`-k 'r,over=16kb+t=sres,over=1mb'`) to give each policy its own threshold.\n\nEach half of a tool call is judged on its own size, so `--tools=strip` on a call with a short request and a huge response drops only the response. `--tools=omit` removes whole pairs, so it is judged on the two halves combined.")

