help: Some("Remove compaction events from the stream")
long_help: Some("Remove compaction events from the stream.\n\nWithout a value, removes every compaction event, restoring the raw event history so the LLM sees all original events. With a value (`--reset=2`), removes only that compaction event, numbered as `jp conversation show` lists them. Mutually exclusive with the policy, range, and DSL flags: `--reset` undoes compaction, it does not re-compact in the same invocation. Composes with `--dry-run` to preview the removal.")

