help: Some("Protect the last N turns from the selection")
long_help: Some("Protect the last N turns from the selection.\n\nAccepts the same forms as `--keep-first`, except `last-compaction`, which only makes sense at the start. Composes with every other selector: the selection ends no later than the last unprotected turn.")

