help: Some("Output style preset")
long_help: Some("Output style preset.\n\n- `user`: Show only user messages. Hides assistant messages, reasoning, and tool calls entirely. - `chat`: Show only user and assistant messages. Hides reasoning and tool calls entirely. - `brief`: Hide reasoning, tool arguments, and tool results. Shows only user messages, assistant messages, and tool call headers. - `full`: Show everything including reasoning, tool arguments, and untruncated tool results.")

