set: []
help: Some("Keep using this workspace even from inside another one")
long_help: Some("Keep using this workspace even from inside another one.\n\nWithout it, standing in a different workspace makes JP ask which of the two you meant. With it, the selection wins and JP stops asking; every run from elsewhere reports the workspace it used.\n\nA later `jp workspace use` without `--always` releases it, and `jp workspace use cwd` clears the selection outright.")

